sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Telegram
    participant D as daemon/parser
    participant E as executor
    participant G as Entry guards
    participant B as Existing MT5
    participant L as Ledger/events
    T->>D: permitted message
    D->>D: parse, dedupe, HALT/PAUSE gate
    alt blocked or invalid
        D->>L: rejected/skipped evidence
    else candidate
        D->>E: execute candidate with identity
        E->>G: evaluate risk and authority
        alt unavailable or denied
            G-->>E: deny with reason
            E->>L: denial evidence, zero sends
        else allowed
            G-->>E: allow
            E->>B: guarded order request
            B-->>E: result / retcode / ticket
            E->>L: actual result, not inferred fill
        end
    end
    Note over B,L: Reconcile unknown outcomes before any replay
